OL,3,GNEWSAMatch to support footballer
OL,4,Abattling brain tumour
OL,5,
OL,6,FA women's football match on Sunday will
OL,7,Fbe dedicated to a teenage player who is
OL,8,Fcurrently undergoing treatment for a
OL,9,Fbrain tumour.
OL,11,FRoxy Thomas, 18, who plays for Torquay
OL,12,FUnited Women, received the diagnosis in
OL,13,FAugust and is currently in intensive
OL,14,Fcare in Bristol following a series of
OL,15,Foperations.
OL,17,FA fundraiser was set up to support
OL,18,FThomas and her family and has raised
OL,19,Fupwards of #22,000.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
